msgid "Only WAN MAC, LAN MAC and Serial Number are edited here. LAN defaults to WAN+1 (editable). The other factory fields are preserved untouched."
msgstr "这里只编辑 WAN MAC、LAN MAC 和序列号。LAN 默认为 WAN+1（可手动修改），其余原厂字段保持不变。"

msgid "On save, ethaddr is written as the WAN MAC and oui as its first three octets (00:AA:BB). On a stock device the `oui` variable does not exist yet — Save will create it."
msgstr "保存时会写入：ethaddr = WAN MAC，oui = WAN 前三个字节（00:AA:BB）。原厂设备通常尚未定义 oui 变量，Save 时会自动创建。"

msgid "On save, ethaddr is written as the WAN MAC and oui as its first three octets (00:AA:BB). The values below are the current stored values on disk."
msgstr ""

msgid "On save, ethaddr is written as the WAN MAC and oui as its first three octets (00:AA:BB). These are read-only here and updated together with the factory block."
msgstr ""

msgid "Editing WAN MAC auto-links: LAN = WAN+1, U-Boot ethaddr = WAN, OUI = first 3 octets."
msgstr "编辑 WAN MAC 会自动联动：LAN = WAN+1、U-Boot ethaddr = WAN、OUI = 前三个字节。"

